#. module: l10n_ca_on_payroll
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ca_on_payroll.field_hr_contract__l10n_ca_on_td1_type
msgid ""
"Basic personal amount: the claim is the Ontario basic personal amount of the"
" year, as when the employee files no TD1ON. Total claim amount: the amount "
"of line 10 of the TD1ON, 0 for claim code 0. Exempt: the employee expects a "
"total income below the claim; no Ontario tax is withheld except the Ontario "
"Health Premium on an annual income above 20,000. A non-resident whose "
"federal claim is 0 has an Ontario claim of 0 as well: choose the total claim"
" amount and leave it at 0."
msgstr ""

